{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13715","headline":"谢王郎中见赠琴鹤 · 顾况","name":"谢王郎中见赠琴鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此琴等焦尾，此鹤方胎生。\n赴节何徘徊，理感物自幷。\n独立江海上，一弹天地清。\n朱弦动瑶华，白羽飘玉京。\n因想羡门辈，眇然四体轻。\n子乔翔邓林，王母游层城。\n忽如啓灵署，鸾凤相和鸣。\n何由玉女牀，去食琅玕英。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}